{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-03-23 07:00:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE PARTNERS WITH ACCESSFINTECH TO TRANSFORM RESOLUTION OF SETTLEMENT FAILS', 'text': "NEW YORK, MARCH 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROADRIDGE\xa0FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE:BR), A GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER, HAS PARTNERED WITH ACCESSFINTECH TO DELIVER A NEW STRATEGIC GATEWAY FOR SETTLEMENT WORKFLOW THAT OFFERS EFFICIENCIES IN RESOLVING MULTI-PARTY SETTLEMENT FAILS. THE SOLUTION IS POWERED BY BROADRIDGE'S INDUSTRY-LEADING POST-TRADE PLATFORMS AND DATA, AND INCORPORATES ACCESSFINTECH'S CLOUD-BASED OPERATIONS WORKFLOW MODEL."}